Subject: [PATCH] fix(slot): explain the fixed pass order for a groove

Show Auto on the Slot Passes tab and explain how the connected path fills the groove. Give the same reason when MCP receives a pass_start setting. Keep existing Slot toolpaths and project files unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

